stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INIT: daemon 启动
    
    INIT --> STARTING: session.start()<br/>或自动触发
    STARTING --> STARTING: 等待 Portal 响应
    
    STARTING --> STARTED: Start 响应 code=0<br/>(用户点了"允许")
    STARTING --> STOPPED: Start 响应 code=1<br/>(用户拒绝)
    
    STARTED --> STOPPED: Portal Closed 信号<br/>或探测失败
    
    STOPPED --> STARTING: session.start()<br/>重新授权
    STOPPED --> [*]: daemon 退出

    note right of INIT: 啥都没干，等着
    note right of STARTED: 可以发 input.* 命令了
    note right of STOPPED: 拒绝后不自动重启<br/>防止弹窗风暴